    <entry xml:lang="en">
        <title>The Value of Time and Struggle</title>
        <published>2026-08-21T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-08-21T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>Michael Park</name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://mhpark.me/posts/what-its-all-for/"/>
        <id>https://mhpark.me/posts/what-its-all-for/</id>
        
        <summary type="html">&lt;p&gt;I have many conflicting thoughts that I -- as a data engineer, a consultant, a
member of society, a friend to some, and husband to one -- am going to try to
articulate throughout the course of this post. I will do my best to organise my
thoughts throughout this piece in way that at least helps me formalise how I am
currently feeling about my long-term future in data and software engineering over the last two years of using AI to various degrees.&lt;/p&gt;</summary>
        
    </entry>
